                             Collector of Q1.\n    34\t    *   **Regulation:** Q1 Emitter drives `LDOIN`. Q1 Base is driven directly by `NPNB`.\n    35\t*   **Internal Regulators:**\n    36\t    *                           
                             **AVDD/CVDD/DVDD:** Decoupled by C6 (1\u03bcF), C9 (1\u03bcF), C7 (4.7\u03bcF), C8 (1\u03bcF).\n    37\t    *   **LDOIN:** C59 (0.1\u03bcF).\n    38\t    *   **NEG5V:** C3                       
